All players will need to use the spell [[Bind Affinity]] to set their respawn location and must rely on classes with the spell. If you do not have this spell you cannot set your own bind location. Send a tell to a level 12 caster. You have to talk to them. You meet them. Then group with them. Then he or she has to target you. Then he or she casts a spell on you that makes you bound to the area.  Classic locations that allowed players without the spell to be bound can be found in the table below.
